# Production build config (SH2). Firebase web values are PUBLIC client config, safe to ship in the bundle: the API's
# Firebase-token guard and the owner allowlist are the real security. This is the "Uma Platform web" app in project
# uma-rpg (one login for every app, IN3). The auth domain is the Hosting domain, so the auth handler is same-origin
# inside the iOS Home Screen app. Written by SH2 from infra/bootstrap.sh's output.
